    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908990/extras/66f5d3943d733ab13fe41d8a778e4798.poster.avif?t=1691629453\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908990/extras/66f5d3943d733ab13fe41d8a778e4798.webm?t=1691629453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Help Froggy complete a quest in this colorful platformer adventure! Use your sticky tongue to pull, push, and grapple through many challenging levels while collecting as many flies as you can.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908990/extras/851bbebfb3ab2957d6a2367268101075.poster.avif?t=1691629453\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908990/extras/851bbebfb3ab2957d6a2367268101075.webm?t=1691629453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><strong>Features:</strong><li>A cute, single-player frog adventure!<br></li><li>Dozens of well-crafted levels with flies scattered throughout for an added challenge<br></li><li>Several themed worlds<br></li><li>Fully customizable frog with 7 colors and over 30 unlockable hats<br></li><li>New enemies, obstacles, and challenges introduced every level<br></li><li>Intense boss battles<br></li><li>Mini games</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908990/extras/b59e35791efb5c5b3013dd76cccfe1a8.poster.avif?t=1691629453\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908990/extras/b59e35791efb5c5b3013dd76cccfe1a8.webm?t=1691629453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Gameplay:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Smooth, simple controls<br></li><li>A hybrid of precision-based action and challenging puzzles<br></li><li>Use your tongue to move objects to reach higher places, protect from hazards, or block enemy paths.<br></li><li>Two types of jumps: a shorter horizontal jump, or a higher stationary jump.</li></ul>",
